<title>POLAND: Bank Komunalny Q3 net up to PLN 2.6 mln.</title>
<headline>Bank Komunalny Q3 net up to PLN 2.6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Komunalny SA results for the third quarter ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>					    Q3 1996	Q3 1995</p>
<p>    operating profit			3.25   vs   2.05</p>
<p>    net					 2.58   vs   1.63</p>
<p>    pre-tax				   3.25   vs   2.05</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name is Bank Komunalny w Gdyni SA.</p>
<p>    revenues from securities	    0.01   vs   0.01</p>
<p>    interest and similar revenues     9.13   vs   5.16</p>
<p>    interest and similar costs	  5.15   vs   3.80</p>
<p>    revenues from commission	    0.71   vs   0.34</p>
<p>    costs of commission		   0.01   vs   0.00</p>
<p>    income tax				0.66   vs   0.42</p>
<p>    other taxes			     0.00   vs   0.00</p>
<p>    extraordinary			   0.00   vs   0.00</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p>    operating profit			8.45   vs   5.80</p>
<p>    net					 6.27   vs   4.21</p>
<p>    pre-tax				   8.45   vs   5.80</p>
<p>    revenues from securities	    0.03   vs   0.02</p>
<p>    interest and similar revenues    25.14   vs  14.78</p>
